spice
* MOSFET Differential Pair with Current Source
* Transistors
M1 5 4 7 7 NMOS
M2 2 4 7 7 NMOS

* Resistors
RD1 3 5 RD
RD2 3 2 RD

* Current Source
I1 7 4 ISS

* Voltage Source
VDD 3 0 DC VDD

* In this netlist, nodes are:
* 3 - VDD
* 2 - M2 Drain and Output
* 4 - Vin and Common Gate
* 5 - M1 Drain
* 7 - Source of M1 and M2 (connected to ISS and Ground)